#: adddlg.cpp:145
msgid "Enter the name of the task here. This name is for your eyes only."
msgstr "invoer die naam van die opdrag hier. hierdie naam is vir jou oë slegs."

#: adddlg.cpp:146
msgid ""
"If you select this radio button, you specify that you want to enter the time "
"as absolute values. For example: total for this task is 20 hours and 15 "
"minutes.\n"
"\n"
"The time is specified for the session time and for the total time separately."
msgstr ""
"as jy kies hierdie radio knoppie, jy spesifiseer wat jy wil hê aan invoer "
"die tyd <-invoer->as absolute waardes. vir voorbeeld: totaal vir hierdie "
"opdrag is 20 ure en 15 <-invoer->minute.\n"
"<-invoer->\n"
"<-invoer->die tyd is gespesifiseer vir die sessie tyd en vir die totaal tyd "
"apart."

#: adddlg.cpp:151
msgid ""
"If you select this radio button, you specify that you want to add or "
"subtract time for the task. For example: I've worked 2 hours and 20 minutes "
"more on this task (without having the timer running.)\n"
"\n"
"This time will be added or subtracted for both the session time and the "
"total time."
msgstr ""

#: adddlg.cpp:157
msgid "This is the overall time this task has been running."
msgstr "hierdie is die algeheel tyd hierdie opdrag het al wat loop."

#: adddlg.cpp:158
msgid "This is the time the task has been running this session."
msgstr "hierdie is die tyd die opdrag het al wat loop hierdie sessie."

#: adddlg.cpp:159
msgid "Specify how much time to add or subtract to the overall and session time"
msgstr "spesifiseer hoe baie tyd aan voeg by of aftrek aan die algeheel en sessie tyd"

